#: ../../source/docs/building-px4-with-qtcreator.rst:9
#: ac2dbff25bb044ca8688695826f0be27
msgid "**ARCHIVED ARTICLE**"
msgstr "**已归档文章**"

#: ../../source/docs/building-px4-with-qtcreator.rst:11
#: dfe4c02a9a31437cbefc7dc950fc5a6c
msgid "ArduPilot no longer supports Qt Creator."
msgstr "ArduPilot 不再支持 Qt Creator。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-px4-with-qtcreator.rst:14
#: 57585743f8e2474ea9a79fa42d9f76b3
msgid ""
"This article shows how you can set up Qt Creator for editing ArduPilot code "
"and building for Pixhawk targets on Windows and Linux."
msgstr ""
"本文介绍如何在 Windows 和 Linux 上配置 Qt Creator，用于编辑 ArduPilot 代码并为 Pixhawk 目标构建。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-px4-with-qtcreator.rst:18
#: d2798a925c5d438d896b8c26c7d96d25
msgid "Preconditions for Linux"
msgstr "Linux 前提条件"

#: ../../source/docs/building-px4-with-qtcreator.rst:20
#: f9b3b0d074c3400c859886611b23093a
msgid ""
"Follow the instructions in :ref:`Building for Pixhawk on Linux with Make "
"<building-px4-with-make>` to download the required source code (*ardupilot*,"
" *PX4Firmware* and *PX4NuttX*) and toolchain."
msgstr ""
"按照 :ref:`在 Linux 上使用 Make 为 Pixhawk 构建 <building-px4-with-make>` "
"中的说明下载所需源码（*ardupilot*、*PX4Firmware* 和 *PX4NuttX*）及工具链。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-px4-with-qtcreator.rst:24
#: e9b4a6bc0dd44494b74d36a467239ef6
msgid "Preconditions for Windows"
msgstr "Windows 前提条件"

#: ../../source/docs/building-px4-with-qtcreator.rst:26
#: 7abdb8c510a149808b6f184e5c2f259a
msgid ""
"Follow the instructions in :ref:`Pixhawk on Windows with Make <building-"
"px4-with-make>` to download the required source code (*ardupilot*, "
"*PX4Firmware* and *PX4NuttX*) and toolchain."
msgstr ""
"按照 :ref:`在 Windows 上使用 Make 为 Pixhawk 构建 <building-px4-with-make>` "
"中的说明下载所需源码（*ardupilot*、*PX4Firmware* 和 *PX4NuttX*）及工具链。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-px4-with-qtcreator.rst:29
#: ee2747aae18147d8a0b130640d1f9fa5
msgid ""
"Make sure you have no Cygwin installed (or have it at least out of the "
"environment variables), as this can get in the way of the PX4 toolchain."
msgstr "确保没有安装 Cygwin（或至少从环境变量中移除），否则可能干扰 PX4 工具链。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-px4-with-qtcreator.rst:33
#: 6388bb3d63c8414ca2c43fe2e6867314
msgid "Install Qt Creator"
msgstr "安装 Qt Creator"

#: ../../source/docs/building-px4-with-qtcreator.rst:35
#: 889283a8423946ed89bb8a221de4f2a0
msgid ""
"Download Qt and the Qt Creator IDE from the `Qt Creator website "
"<https://www.qt.io/ide/>`__"
msgstr "从 `Qt Creator 官网 <https://www.qt.io/ide/>`__ 下载 Qt 和 Qt Creator IDE。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-px4-with-qtcreator.rst:36
#: 729eeab89777403a8ebdbd6188010efb
msgid "Follow the instructions to install the IDE on your platform."
msgstr "按照平台说明安装 IDE。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-px4-with-qtcreator.rst:39
#: 37a06529615446058aaf8dca8654c561
msgid "Run Qt Creator on Windows"
msgstr "在 Windows 上运行 Qt Creator"

#: ../../source/docs/building-px4-with-qtcreator.rst:41
#: 4afdc97d494a4f6981d1e861e9b35aa5
msgid ""
"We try to make sure that Qt Creator is running with all the necessary "
"environment variables that are needed to build an ArduPilot project."
msgstr "我们尽量确保 Qt Creator 在运行时具备构建 ArduPilot 项目所需的所有环境变量。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-px4-with-qtcreator.rst:44
#: 7bbf5a93b2294250b09d5cdefd85c7cb
msgid ""
"Go to your local PX4 toolchain directory and create a file called "
"**qtcreator.sh**."
msgstr "进入本地 PX4 工具链目录，创建一个名为 **qtcreator.sh** 的文件。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-px4-with-qtcreator.rst:51
#: 3ce6235d736241d99fbf92a8f841c64d
msgid ""
"Go to the *toolchain\\\\msys\\\\1.0* subdirectory of the PX4 toolchain "
"directory and make a copy of the file **px4_console.bat** , called "
"**px4_qt_creator.bat**. Change this file in *:startsh* section, so that it "
"becomes:"
msgstr ""
"进入 PX4 工具链目录的 *toolchain\\\\msys\\\\1.0* 子目录，复制 **px4_console.bat** 文件，命名为 "
"**px4_qt_creator.bat**。修改该文件的 *:startsh* 部分，使其变为："

#: ../../source/docs/building-px4-with-qtcreator.rst:62
#: 9a627bdc48ed4c85b59b65fd2a010c04
msgid ""
"Optional: create a Windows shortcut to the **px4_qt_creator.bat** for easy "
"access."
msgstr "可选：为 **px4_qt_creator.bat** 创建 Windows 快捷方式以便快速访问。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-px4-with-qtcreator.rst:64
#: 10ec819bf5334d4cbd3e5c1e209ddce8
msgid "Start up Qt Creator by starting up **px4_qt_creator.bat**"
msgstr "通过运行 **px4_qt_creator.bat** 启动 Qt Creator。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-px4-with-qtcreator.rst:67
#: e77b471d85e24db1880722413cfb9ab1
msgid "Run Qt Creator on Linux"
msgstr "在 Linux 上运行 Qt Creator"

#: ../../source/docs/building-px4-with-qtcreator.rst:69
#: 6e69151cfc9b4cdeb69974954412c5df
msgid ""
"If you installed the gcc-arm cross-compiler and made sure that the cross-"
"compiler is in your path, then it suffices to simply start up Qt Creator."
msgstr "如果已安装 gcc-arm 交叉编译器并确保其在 PATH 中，只需直接启动 Qt Creator 即可。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-px4-with-qtcreator.rst:73
#: 491afa680e4d4e45a533aef9aaf59798
msgid "Create a project"
msgstr "创建项目"

#: ../../source/docs/building-px4-with-qtcreator.rst:75
#: c94643747fbf41a3b2305d9bfc52a9b7
msgid "Select **File** -> **New File or Project**."
msgstr "选择 **File** -> **New File or Project**。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-px4-with-qtcreator.rst:77
#: 092071c0dc6440ba9f3fefc50f008cc4
msgid ""
"Choose the **Import Project** template and from these templates **Import "
"Existing Project**. Then press **Next**."
msgstr ""
"选择 **Import Project** 模板，从中选择 **Import Existing Project**，然后点击 **Next**。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-px4-with-qtcreator.rst:82
#: a14e931bf5c64184b00cbbcf9437b1f9
msgid ""
"Enter a project name and choose the location of the ArduPilot Git "
"repository. Then press **Next**."
msgstr "输入项目名称并选择 ArduPilot git 仓库的位置，然后点击 **Next**。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-px4-with-qtcreator.rst:87
#: f7a9dbdefd8b4748b36325f1ce5f5e1b
msgid ""
"Qt Creator shows you the files that will be imported into the project. Just "
"press **Next** (we will worry about this a bit later)."
msgstr "Qt Creator 会显示将导入项目的文件，直接点击 **Next**（稍后再处理此部分）。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-px4-with-qtcreator.rst:92
#: 815ee1c86cb242d5ad01f961299beb27
msgid ""
"The summary of the project settings is shown in the next screen. It is "
"interesting to see which files are generated:"
msgstr "下一屏幕将显示项目设置摘要，其中列出了生成的文件："

#: ../../source/docs/building-px4-with-qtcreator.rst:94
#: e2a7d1480fb5413d8835521df5c05d29
msgid "the **.files** file contains all the files that need to be edited."
msgstr "**.files** 文件包含所有需要编辑的文件。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-px4-with-qtcreator.rst:96
#: 965146880df84e92b6c8d3beb6455b0f
msgid ""
"the **.includes** file contains all directories containing header files that"
" might be useful to consult during development."
msgstr "**.includes** 文件包含所有包含头文件的目录，在开发过程中可能有用。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-px4-with-qtcreator.rst:102
#: b06f12df6b8047f691e9becf9f583f1c
msgid "Update the project with Git hooks"
msgstr "使用 git hooks 更新项目"

#: ../../source/docs/building-px4-with-qtcreator.rst:103
#: 1171e1c923494f8db6badeeb92c402dd
msgid ""
"A fixed project is not useful, because files can get renamed or be added or "
"removed by commits from other contributors."
msgstr "固定项目不实用，因为其他贡献者的提交可能导致文件被重命名、添加或删除。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-px4-with-qtcreator.rst:105
#: 61a1eddb57d040d096c4eb1c2ea0a434
msgid ""
"Therefore, it is useful to let the Qt Creator project be updated each time a"
" new incoming change from a remote repository updates your own repository."
msgstr "因此，每当远程仓库的新传入更改更新了你的本地仓库时，让 Qt Creator 项目自动更新是很有用的。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-px4-with-qtcreator.rst:108
#: f17bb809fdba411793a2c1bb8e3a2bc9
msgid ""
"The tactic is that we first create a \"project generation script\" that will"
" update the project's **.files** and **.includes** files and then let Git "
"hooks call this script each time when it assumed to be appropriate."
msgstr ""
"策略是先创建一个「项目生成脚本」来更新项目的 **.files** 和 **.includes** 文件，然后让 git hooks "
"在适当时机调用该脚本。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-px4-with-qtcreator.rst:112
#: f87626bba1c8413a8f7759a0a1f5652c
msgid "Windows script"
msgstr "Windows 脚本"

#: ../../source/docs/building-px4-with-qtcreator.rst:113
#: d5971c737200408d86c5f900b76d2d62
msgid "Create a file called **generate_ardupilot_project.bat**:"
msgstr "创建名为 **generate_ardupilot_project.bat** 的文件："

#: ../../source/docs/building-px4-with-qtcreator.rst:134
#: 97469abe0a1f4911bf856e9c5fac40cf
msgid "Linux script"
msgstr "Linux 脚本"

#: ../../source/docs/building-px4-with-qtcreator.rst:135
#: 8653fc01d5e3434cbb8a07dd89cc8166
msgid "Create a file called **generate_ardupilot_project.sh**:"
msgstr "创建名为 **generate_ardupilot_project.sh** 的文件："

#: ../../source/docs/building-px4-with-qtcreator.rst:155
#: 0b4badc79ea34094bb203c5a0a3a5af9
msgid "Git hooks"
msgstr "git hooks"

#: ../../source/docs/building-px4-with-qtcreator.rst:156
#: ce335f68cd7e4164bee183913aa3e0de
msgid ""
"Open a command line interface and browse to the **.git/hooks** subfolder in "
"the project folder."
msgstr "打开命令行界面，切换到项目文件夹中的 **.git/hooks** 子文件夹。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-px4-with-qtcreator.rst:158
#: 305dec5853bc466e9ee33c2845477e8f
msgid ""
"Change the **post-merge** and **post-checkout** files so that they become:"
msgstr "修改 **post-merge** 和 **post-checkout** 文件，使其变为："

#: ../../source/docs/building-px4-with-qtcreator.rst:166
#: c68c3e9993904549a63ddb18f4ce109e
msgid ""
"Another option is to make symbolic links in between the Git hook files and "
"the generation script. In Linux for example, that is achieved by:"
msgstr "另一种方式是在 git hook 文件和生成脚本之间创建符号链接。例如在 Linux 上："

#: ../../source/docs/building-px4-with-qtcreator.rst:175
#: ec0fadea8f224c35a430517264f8535b
msgid "Build the project"
msgstr "构建项目"

#: ../../source/docs/building-px4-with-qtcreator.rst:176
#: 1d99edcb076b4f3a9f296c3c2203794e
msgid "This section discusses how to build the code in Qt Creator."
msgstr "本节介绍如何在 Qt Creator 中构建代码。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-px4-with-qtcreator.rst:178
#: 90b797307a9940be8d933e4c00162e92
msgid ""
"Click on **Projects** on the left pane and make sure that you are in the "
"**Build & Run** tab page."
msgstr "点击左侧面板的 **Projects**，确保你在 **Build & Run** 选项卡页面。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-px4-with-qtcreator.rst:181
#: 415b9426c6a74c7db870ea5b3536a391
msgid "Click **Manage Kits** in the topleft corner."
msgstr "点击左上角的 **Manage Kits**。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-px4-with-qtcreator.rst:183
#: ad90626905e846649dcd52d006785267
msgid ""
"First click on the **Compilers** tab page and then **Add** on the right hand"
" side of the compilers list. Choose an easily recognisable name for your "
"compiler and make sure the Compiler and Make path are referring to the "
"executables of the PX4 toolchain (Windows) or the downloaded gcc-arm cross-"
"compiler (Linux). Also choose \"GCC\" as the Error parser."
msgstr ""
"先点击 **Compilers** 选项卡，然后点击编译器列表右侧的 **Add**。为你的编译器选择一个易于识别的名称，确保 Compiler 和 "
"Make 路径指向 PX4 工具链（Windows）或已下载的 gcc-arm 交叉编译器（Linux）的可执行文件，并选择「GCC」作为错误解析器。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-px4-with-qtcreator.rst:191
#: 8901271fec454a68bcd7f43191fe2f52
msgid ""
"Then click on the **Kits** tab page. Click **Add** on the right hand side."
msgstr "然后点击 **Kits** 选项卡，点击右侧的 **Add**。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-px4-with-qtcreator.rst:193
#: bd7c83aa2f424fafbb5bb626e13c10db
msgid ""
"Choose an easily recognisable name for your build kit and make sure you fill"
" in the proper compiler (the one you just added) and the debugger inside the"
" PX4 toolchain."
msgstr "为你的构建套件选择一个易于识别的名称，并填写合适的编译器（刚添加的那个）和 PX4 工具链中的调试器。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-px4-with-qtcreator.rst:199
#: fe35f55b9ccf4c0b9697340ecf5295a1
msgid "Click **Apply**."
msgstr "点击 **Apply**。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-px4-with-qtcreator.rst:201
#: b3facc329dad46eaaa640de46830521e
msgid ""
"Back on the **Projects** page, click **Add Kit** and choose the Build Kit "
"you just added."
msgstr "返回 **Projects** 页面，点击 **Add Kit** 并选择刚添加的构建套件。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-px4-with-qtcreator.rst:203
#: 0bc347196f904a789563327cfa03aca2
msgid ""
"Now you have one \"Build Configuration\" called \"Default\". You can make as"
" many Build Configurations as you want, but we'll take the ArduCopter build "
"as an example for now. Next to *Edit build configuration*, click on **Add** "
"and choose **Clone Selected** in the drop down menu. Pick a name (e.g. "
"\"Copter\")."
msgstr ""
"此时你有一个名为「Default」的「Build Configuration」。可以创建任意数量的构建配置，这里以 ArduCopter 构建为例。在 "
"*Edit build configuration* 旁边，点击 **Add** 并从下拉菜单选择 **Clone "
"Selected**。选择一个名称（如「Copter」）。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-px4-with-qtcreator.rst:208
#: c079b244d1114c689a8edc1a8310501e
msgid ""
"Click on the **Details** of the *Build Steps* and type \"px4-v2 -j2\" as "
"*Make arguments*. Deselect the **Targets**."
msgstr ""
"点击 *Build Steps* 的 **Details**，将 *Make arguments* 输入为「px4-v2 -j2」。取消选择 "
"**Targets**。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-px4-with-qtcreator.rst:211
#: d2561fe54ae34808a2015336348e9b84
msgid ""
"Click on the **Details** of the *Clean Steps* and type \"px4-clean\" as "
"*Make arguments*. Deselect the **Targets**."
msgstr ""
"点击 *Clean Steps* 的 **Details**，将 *Make arguments* 输入为「px4-clean」。取消选择 "
"**Targets**。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-px4-with-qtcreator.rst:217
#: d14bd34878944b15a88f544cc2d9a969
msgid ""
"You can make other build configurations for e.g. ArduPlane in the same way. "
"You can quickly switch between \"Build Configurations\" by clicking the logo"
" just above the **Run** icon (the green arrow) on the left pane."
msgstr ""
"可以用同样方式为 ArduPlane 等创建其他构建配置。点击左侧面板 **Run** 图标（绿色箭头）上方的 logo，可以快速切换「构建配置」。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-px4-with-qtcreator.rst:221
#: 851594fbf4c241f3a70ef51c275df818
msgid ""
"You can now remove the MSVC or standard GCC build kit (click on the down "
"arrow on the kit itself and choose **Remove Kit**)."
msgstr "现在可以移除 MSVC 或标准 GCC 构建套件（点击套件本身的下拉箭头并选择 **Remove Kit**）。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-px4-with-qtcreator.rst:224
#: 4dc238391c2e4bf7a24b474a47e1cc02
msgid ""
"You're now ready to build the code. Click on **Edit** in the left pane to "
"edit the code and browse through the project. Click **Build project-name** "
"in the *Build* menu (or Ctrl+B) to build the code."
msgstr ""
"现在可以构建代码了。点击左侧面板的 **Edit** 编辑代码并浏览项目。点击 *Build* 菜单中的 **Build project-"
"name**（或 Ctrl+B）来构建代码。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-px4-with-qtcreator.rst:228
#: c852addd54b845acb052ae0322925d5f
msgid "Apply coding style guidelines"
msgstr "应用代码风格规范"

#: ../../source/docs/building-px4-with-qtcreator.rst:229
#: 3b0a9d383a5042408bb6ff96a58dfdd1
msgid ""
"It is useful that the Qt Creator editor is configured so that it "
"automatically applies the layout guidelines described in :ref:`ArduPilot "
"Style Guide <style-guide>`."
msgstr ""
"配置 Qt Creator 编辑器，使其自动应用 :ref:`ArduPilot 代码风格指南 <style-guide>` "
"中描述的布局规范，非常有用。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-px4-with-qtcreator.rst:232
#: 0227242511f44aac988d06d1732ebe7c
msgid ""
"Indentation: Click on the **Tools** menu and choose **Options**. "
"Subsequently, pick the **Text Editor** view and then the **Behaviour** tab "
"page. You can set the tab policy (spaces only) and the size of a tab and "
"indentations (4)."
msgstr ""
"缩进：点击 **Tools** 菜单，选择 **Options**。然后选择 **Text Editor** 视图，再选择 **Behaviour** "
"选项卡。可以设置制表符策略（仅空格）以及制表符和缩进的大小（4）。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-px4-with-qtcreator.rst:236
#: a587b529f1784e9fa887bfe95721b58d
msgid ""
"Other interesting settings can be found in the **C++** view in the same "
"*Options* dialog. You can define how specific parts of your code will be "
"aligned (e.g. assignments, switch/cases, control statements, braces, etc.)"
msgstr ""
"在同一 *Options* 对话框的 **C++** "
"视图中还有其他有趣的设置，可以定义代码特定部分的对齐方式（如赋值、switch/case、控制语句、花括号等）。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-px4-with-qtcreator.rst:239
#: 80fc6049d8d44712a52e34d723a410fc
msgid ""
"Commenting: In order to comply with the coding guidelines , you will need to"
" provide documentation in Doxygen format. Qt Creator will automatically "
"generate a Doxygen documentation template if you type ``/**`` before the "
"definition of the class, function, ..."
msgstr ""
"注释：为符合编码规范，需要以 Doxygen 格式提供文档。在 class、function 等定义前输入 ``/**``，Qt Creator "
"将自动生成 Doxygen 文档模板。"
